    enonce: "<span class=\"q\">1) </span>نعتبر العبارتين:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>(1 + 2<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>) - 17</span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">490</span></span> - 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">40</span></span> - 3</span><br>بيّن أنّ <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = 3 + <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span></span> و <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span> - 3</span><br><span class=\"q\">2) </span>نعتبر العبارتين:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>(1 + 2<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>) - 17</span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">490</span></span> - 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">40</span></span> - 3</span><br>بيّن أنّ a مقلوب b<br><span class=\"q\">3) </span>نعتبر العبارتين:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">a = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>(1 + 2<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span>) - 17</span><br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">b = <span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">490</span></span> - 3<span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">40</span></span> - 3</span><br>احسب العدد الحقيقي:<br><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">C = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\"><span class=\"rad\"><span class=\"rcd\">10</span></span></span><span class=\"den\">a</span></span> + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">b</span></span></span>",
